cpu_makes_no_device_call *  app-only  the test process calls CUDA: default_run_opens_the_device_when_one_exists probes the device (rcsr::backend::probe) as the positive control, so memcheck attaches and gives a verdict; the explicit CPU commands open no /dev/nvidia (strace -f). The children run under strace, which memcheck cannot trace under the default all, so with application-only the one default-dispatch rcsr child of the control run is not sanitized
